    "description": "A row activates one indicator per known in-range value plus bias. Scores are class-wise sums of weights over active indices. Training orders examples by h64(index,seed xor epoch), chooses largest score then smaller class, and adds +1 to gold and -1 to guessed class indicators on errors. Timestamp accumulator U records step*delta; final weights are W-U/(T+1). Prediction ranks scores, emits winning margin and up to five strictly positive winner-minus-runner contributions sorted descending with stable original feature order."
